{"id":"references/Thurston/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06#thurston-ch06-relative-gromov-proportionality","title":"thurston-ch06-relative-gromov-proportionality","path":"references/Thurston/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06.md","line":182,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Thurston/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06.tex#thurston-ch06-relative-gromov-proportionality","uses":["[[references/Thurston/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06#thurston-ch06-relative-gromov-norm]]","[[references/Thurston/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06#thurston-ch06-boundary-small-norm]]","[[references/Thurston/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06#thurston-ch06-torus-filling-bound]]","[[references/Thurston/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06#thurston-ch06-simplex-volume-bound]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Thurston/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06.tex","label":"thurston-ch06-relative-gromov-proportionality","line":253,"source":"\\begin{theorem}[Relative Gromov proportionality]\n\\label{thurston-ch06-relative-gromov-proportionality}\n\\group{relative-invariant}\n\\uses{thurston-ch06-relative-gromov-norm,thurston-ch06-boundary-small-norm,thurston-ch06-torus-filling-bound,thurston-ch06-simplex-volume-bound}\n\\source{thurston:page-0149,thurston:page-0150}\n\nIf $M$ is a complete oriented finite-volume hyperbolic $3$-manifold and $\\overline M$ is its compactification by torus boundary, then\n\\[\n\\|[\\overline M,\\partial\\overline M]\\|_0\n=\\|[\\overline M,\\partial\\overline M]\\|\n=\\frac{v(M)}{v_3}.\n\\]\n\\end{theorem}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section>[Relative Gromov proportionality] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-7468757273746f6e2d636830362d72656c61746976652d67726f6d6f762d70726f706f7274696f6e616c697479\"></span> \\group relative-invariant <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FThurston%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06%23thurston-ch06-r